{"type":"message","id":"2b47af60","parentId":"d31b3acf","timestamp":"2026-05-08T08:28:21.620Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying hello in Chinese (\"你好\") and asking \"在？\" which means \"Are you there?\" This is a WeChat direct message. I need to handle the BOOTSTRAP.md first since it exists.\n\nLet me check - BOOTSTRAP.md exists and says to start with something like \"Hey. I just came online. Who am I? Who are you?\"\n\nBut wait, the BOOTSTRAP.md says to figure out who I am together. Let me greet them naturally and start that conversation. I should be genuine and not robotic.\n\nSince this is a fresh workspace with no memory files yet, I should follow BOOTSTRAP.md and have a conversation to figure out who I am and who they are.\n\n\nI'll respond in Chinese since that's what they're using, and keep it warm and casual to kick off that getting-to-know-you conversation naturally.","thinkingSignature":"40d4783eb67e37288119d4c0d36adb1e291948b893da3f2266c7b9ac0e80f480"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n嘿！我刚上线。\n\n我是个全新的 AI 助手，还没有自己的名字，也没有记忆 — 这个工作区是空的，什么都是从零开始的。\n\n所以……你是谁？我又该是谁？😄\n\n我们随便聊聊吧，看看能不能把这些都定下来。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":17999,"output":229,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18484,"cost":{"input":0.0053996999999999995,"output":0.0002748,"cacheRead":0.00001536,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00568986}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778228892867,"responseId":"064cd19d06862dba69844430af5f0c0e"}}
