{"type":"message","id":"35b9bf19","parentId":"c689ecdb","timestamp":"2026-05-08T08:35:28.672Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what I can do. Let me give them a concise summary of my capabilities.\n","thinkingSignature":"33c5b1cb447377509b33eb1c2438c47cf1200d621405a2aa3182cc2f8353a725"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n我能做挺多的，简单说：\n\n**信息 & 搜索**\n- 网页搜索、查资料、翻译\n\n**文件 & 代码**\n- 读写文件、写代码、调试、数据处理\n\n**生成**\n- 图片生成、音乐生成、视频生成\n- 文字转语音（TTS）\n\n**浏览器 & 自动化**\n- 控制浏览器自动操作网页\n- 填表、点击、截图、数据抓取\n\n**助手功能**\n- 帮你规划任务、协调多步骤工作\n- 提醒、总结、写作\n\n**系统 & 开发**\n- 执行 shell 命令、管理进程\n- 调用 OpenClaw 的各种工具和配置\n\n---\n\n基本上，你说什么问题、什么需求，我来想办法搞定的。泽平你现在有什么具体要弄的吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":330,"output":172,"cacheRead":15040,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15542,"cost":{"input":0.000099,"output":0.0002064,"cacheRead":0.0009023999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0012078}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778229315447,"responseId":"064cd34300bae7b07c338265307aef84"}}
