{"type":"message","id":"6e57dfc4","parentId":"7ec83659","timestamp":"2026-05-08T08:44:58.535Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking \"图片有什么？\" which means \"What's in the image?\" - they seem to not have seen my previous response about the lottery ticket, or they're asking again. I just described it above - it was a China Welfare Lottery (双色球) ticket. Let me give a brief answer.\n","thinkingSignature":"2523906dcd1b1149f2160972d3c63ba6d515b113cad0868507d444e1e8270363"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n一张中国福利彩票**双色球**，2026年5月5日买的，3组号码共6元，东莞石碣镇出的。\n\n买了没中奖？😄"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":665,"output":99,"cacheRead":16064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16828,"cost":{"input":0.0001995,"output":0.0001188,"cacheRead":0.0009638399999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0012821399999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778229886474,"responseId":"064cd57ef824c66785aad9618492ab44"}}
