{"type":"message","id":"0f91472d","parentId":"0088a64d","timestamp":"2026-05-08T08:45:29.772Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is upset about not winning the lottery. I should be empathetic but also honest about the odds.\n","thinkingSignature":"3774f2de001fdaca4df3a8f50771750001d79ca7a18f8ed1b8156dd00a1068ff"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n哈哈，6块钱买个希望，不中也正常，双色球头奖概率大概是1700万分之一，比被雷劈中还难 😄\n\n不过2块进福利基金，也算是做了好事了～\n\n下次买吗？🧊"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":268,"output":72,"cacheRead":16512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16852,"cost":{"input":0.0000804,"output":0.0000864,"cacheRead":0.0009907199999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0011575199999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778229921278,"responseId":"064cd5a1eb35569002c5f406f3a24587"}}
