{"type":"message","id":"d1760835","parentId":"cef12c12","timestamp":"2026-05-08T09:29:49.838Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found the 428 room lease information. Let me summarize what I see:\n\n- **Room:** 有米公寓（南城沙苑市场）-428\n- **Current lease (4th contract):** 租期：2026/03/01 - 2026/05/31，租期3个月\n\nSo the current lease expires on **2026年5月31日** (May 31, 2026).\n","thinkingSignature":"b729c80f77c7869fa69d91c7b338cb66d7210da540a67bb01cb8db067fb8e27c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n找到了宝！**有米公寓（南城沙苑市场）-428** 的租约情况：\n\n---\n\n**当前租约（第4次签约）：**\n- 📅 **租期：** 2026年3月1日 → **2026年5月31日**\n- ⏱️ **租期：** 3个月\n- 👤 **经办人：** 庞世雄\n\n---\n\n也就是说到 **5月31日** 到期，还有不到一个月。宝要安排续租或者找新租客吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2028,"output":202,"cacheRead":37696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39926,"cost":{"input":0.0006083999999999999,"output":0.00024239999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00226176,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0031125599999999995}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778232574397,"responseId":"064cdffe9fb82575f6b24c31b3fcb651"}}
