{"type":"custom_message","customType":"openclaw.runtime-context","content":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"o9cq802dCUlbYIrFHu3-NkzTM0xk@im.wechat\",\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1778232686210-d158e7d0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-05-08 17:31 GMT+8\"\n}\n```","display":false,"details":{"source":"openclaw-runtime-context"},"id":"44a38486","parentId":"7a324a02","timestamp":"2026-05-08T09:31:28.489Z"}
{"type":"message","id":"f6dbcb16","parentId":"44a38486","timestamp":"2026-05-08T09:31:47.823Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking which tools I used to complete the browser operation. Let me explain the process.\n","thinkingSignature":"bd467b743ad7b5bd87e3f8bee523c001013086455f9aaa36c8dee768ddbf4914"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n宝，我用了这些工具来完成刚才的操作：\n\n---\n\n**1. `agent-browser open`** — 打开目标网址\n```\nagent-browser open \"https://gez.dongguanbank.cn/landlord/#/house/index\"\n```\n\n**2. `agent-browser snapshot -i`** — 截图当前页面，查看所有可交互元素（按钮、输入框等），获取元素引用编号如 `@e5`、`@e10`\n\n**3. `agent-browser click @eN`** — 点击指定编号的元素（同意协议、登录按钮等）\n\n**4. `agent-browser fill @eN \"内容\"`** — 填写输入框（手机号、密码、搜索词）\n\n**5. `agent-browser check @eN`** — 勾选复选框\n\n**6. `agent-browser press Enter`** — 模拟按回车键\n\n**7. `agent-browser wait --load networkidle`** — 等待页面网络空闲（等待页面加载完成）\n\n**8. `agent-browser get attr / text / url`** — 获取元素属性、文本或当前URL\n\n---\n\n**核心逻辑就是：**\n\n```\n打开页面 → 截图看有什么 → 根据编号点击/填内容 → 等待加载 → 再截图 → 继续操作\n```\n\nRefs（`@e5` 这类编号）是动态的，每次截图后重新生成，所以操作顺序很重要 🧊"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":21484,"output":305,"cacheRead":18368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40157,"cost":{"input":0.0064452,"output":0.000366,"cacheRead":0.0011020799999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00791328}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778232688489,"responseId":"064ce070d05f414e3d4c9009a60ef308"}}
