g-with-pull-requests/proposing-changes-to-your-work-with-pull-requests/about-comparing-branches-in-pull-requests#three-dot-and-two-dot-git-diff-comparisons).\\n\\n base repository:\\n openclaw/openclaw\\n\\n Failed to load repositories. Confirm that selected base ref is valid, then try again.\\n\\n base:\\n v2026.5.6\\n\\n Choose a base ref\\n\\n Branches\\n Tags\\n\\n ...\\n\\n head repository:\\n openclaw/openclaw\\n\\n Failed to load repositories. Confirm that selected head ref is valid, then try again.\\n\\n compare:\\n v2026.5.7\\n\\n Choose a head ref\\n\\n Branches\\n Tags\\n\\n 28\\n contributors\\n\\n [Commits\\n 76](#commits_bucket)\\n\\n [Files changed\\n 345](#files_bucket)\\n\\n https://github.com\\n\\n &copy; 2026 GitHub, Inc.\\n\\n- [Terms](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/github-terms/github-terms-of-service)\\n\\n- [Privacy](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement)\\n\\n- [Security](https://github.com/security)\\n\\n- [Status](https://www.githubstatus.com/)\\n\\n- [Community](https://github.community/)\\n\\n- [Docs](https://docs.github.com/)\\n\\n- [Contact](https://support.github.com?tags=dotcom-footer)\\n\\n- Manage cookies\\n\\n- Do not share my personal information\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a9276698fee702d4\\\">>>\"\n}"}],"details":{"persistedDetailsTruncated":true,"originalDetailsBytesAtLeast":8193,"originalDetailKeys":["url","finalUrl","status","contentType","title","extractMode","extractor","externalContent","truncated","length","rawLength","wrappedLength","fetchedAt","tookMs","text","warning"],"status":200,"truncated":false},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778235677739}}
{"type":"message","id":"02b37a3e","parentId":"7cd368c8","timestamp":"2026-05-08T10:21:41.654Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The compare page couldn't load the refs. But from the release page I got some content. Let me compile what I found from the release page and provide it to the user.\n\nFrom the release page content, I could see:\n\n**Fixes mentioned:**\n1. **Release/plugin publishing:** retry transient ClawHub CLI dependency install failures, keep preview-passing plugins publishable when one preview cell flakes, and verify every expected ClawHub package version after publish so maintenance releases are faster to recover and less likely to hide partial plugin publishes.\n\n2. **OpenAI:** support openai/chat-latest as an explicit direct API-key model override for trying the moving ChatGPT Instant API alias without changing the stable default model.\n\n3. **Cron CLI:** include computed status in cron list --json and cron show --json output so external tooling can read disabled/running/ok/error/skipped/idle state without reimplementing cron status derivation. (PR #78701)\n\nThe page shows 76 commits and 345 files changed between v2026.5.6 and v2026.5.7, with 28 contributors.\n\n\nSince I can't retrieve the full commit changelog through web fetch, I'll work with the release notes I've already captured and give the user what I have.\n","thinkingSignature":"dcc8c2a8c1b82f576ffc78563211a1eb4cf44ad4375e6cfb8236c0539c03cf82"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n宝，从发布页面上看到的信息有限，不过还是能整理出来：\n\n---\n\n## v2026.5.7 主要修复内容\n\n从 v2026.5.6 → v2026.5.7，共 **76 个 commits，345 个文件变更，28 位贡献者**\n\n### 已公布的修复：\n\n**1. Release/插件发布**\n- 重试 ClawHub CLI 依赖安装的临时失败\n- 当一个预览单元格 flaky 时，仍保持预览通过的插件可发布\n- 每次发布后验证所有预期的 ClawHub 包版本，使维护版本恢复更快，减少隐藏部分插件发布的问题\n\n**2. OpenAI 模型支持**\n- 支持 `openai/chat-latest` 作为显式直接 API-Key 模型覆盖，用于尝试 ChatGPT Instant API 移动别名，而不改变稳定的默认模型\n\n**3. Cron CLI**\n- 在 `cron list --json` 和 `cron show --json` 输出中包含计算后的状态，使外部工具可以读取 disabled/running/ok/error/skipped/idle 状态，无需重新实现 cron 状态派生逻辑（PR #78701）\n\n---\n\n不过 GitHub 的对比页面没完全加载出来，更详细的 commit 列表没抓到。整体来说这个版本偏向 **发布流程优化、CLI 工具增强、模型支持扩展**，核心功能没大变化，宝要不要更新看具体需求 🧊"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2544,"output":538,"cacheRead":49152,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52234,"cost":{"input":0.0007632,"output":0.0006456,"cacheRead":0.0029491199999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0043579199999999995}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778235677742,"responseId":"064cec1d0ff11f5e1f4034177ccc5983"}}
