{"type":"message","id":"defb09fa","parentId":"15986026","timestamp":"2026-05-08T10:48:53.224Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a more detailed explanation of what the Cron CLI fix means. Let me explain it in a simple way.\n","thinkingSignature":"079343e173e1dff949efb70ca6fb06cae0c464a7de725440d3e61f4f30bd3c27"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n宝，我给你解释一下：\n\n---\n\n## 之前的情况\n\nOpenClaw 的 cron（定时任务）系统，内部有自己的任务状态计算逻辑，比如：\n- 任务是否被禁用（disabled）\n- 任务是否正在运行（running）\n- 任务是否正常（ok）\n- 任务是否出错（error）\n- 任务是否被跳过（skipped）\n- 任务是否空闲（idle）\n\n但这些状态**没有直接输出**到命令行工具里。\n\n---\n\n## 有了这个修复后\n\n当你运行这些命令时：\n\n```bash\ncron list --json\ncron show --json\n```\n\n现在输出结果里**直接包含计算好的状态字段**，外部工具（比如监控脚本、自动化面板）可以直接读取这些状态，不需要自己重新算一遍。\n\n---\n\n## 举个例子\n\n**修复前** 输出可能只有：\n```json\n{\"name\": \"my-cron\", \"schedule\": \"*/5 * * * *\"}\n```\n\n**修复后** 输出变成：\n```json\n{\"name\": \"my-cron\", \"schedule\": \"*/5 * * * *\", \"status\": \"ok\", \"lastRun\": \"...\"}\n```\n\n外部工具直接拿 `status` 字段就知道任务状态，不用自己算 🧊"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":82459,"output":280,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82995,"cost":{"input":0.024737699999999998,"output":0.000336,"cacheRead":0.00001536,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.025089059999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778237314550,"responseId":"064cf282149726693cdab64ad36e4c53"}}
