{"type":"custom_message","customType":"openclaw.runtime-context","content":"[media attached: /opt/cclaw-client/UbuntuClaw/cclaw/data/media/inbound/f0c7a93e-63da-47bf-a6cb-89d23db3f465.jpg (image/*)]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Absolute and ~ paths only work when they stay inside your allowed file-read boundary; host file:// URLs are blocked. Keep caption in the text body.\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"o9cq802dCUlbYIrFHu3-NkzTM0xk@im.wechat\",\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1778247535204-d10c0445\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-05-08 21:37 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\n[User sent media without caption]","display":false,"details":{"source":"openclaw-runtime-context"},"id":"5743be65","parentId":"2d8bf146","timestamp":"2026-05-08T13:39:00.382Z"}
{"type":"message","id":"a38c4b76","parentId":"5743be65","timestamp":"2026-05-08T13:39:13.437Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent another image. Let me analyze it.\n","thinkingSignature":"008978b62da953a316a150db879e32eb3fc8f4451b67464fded64fc4d5f3fb41"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_94ca2qniopkg_1","name":"image","arguments":{"image":"/opt/cclaw-client/UbuntuClaw/cclaw/data/media/inbound/f0c7a93e-63da-47bf-a6cb-89d23db3f465.jpg","prompt":"描述这张图片的内容"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1332,"output":89,"cacheRead":83072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84493,"cost":{"input":0.00039959999999999996,"output":0.0001068,"cacheRead":0.0049843199999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005490719999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778247540382,"responseId":"064d1a748dd23f4e998ff3a7ea62e98a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"07315841","parentId":"a38c4b76","timestamp":"2026-05-08T13:40:44.023Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_94ca2qniopkg_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是一张关于 **Playwright** 浏览器自动化框架的信息图表（Infographic），其风格呈现为现代、科技感的“技术报告”样式。背景为深蓝色，配以亮蓝色和青色的线条及图标。\n\n以下是该图片内容的详细描述：\n\n### 1. 顶部标题栏\n*   **左侧：** 标注了“BROWSER AUTOMATION FRAMEWORK”（浏览器自动化框架）和“TECH REPORT · P-02”（技术报告 P-02）。\n*   **右侧：** 标注了时间“Q2 · 2026”以及“框架说明”。\n*   **主标题：** 巨大的白色和蓝色文字：“**现代主线 Playwright**”。\n*   **副标题：** “微软开源的现代浏览器自动化框架”。\n\n### 2. 中间核心板块（分三列）\n该部分通过“是什么、怎么实现、能做到什么”三个维度介绍了 Playwright。\n\n*   **第一列：是什么 (Framework)**\n    *   **图标：** 代码符号 `</>`。\n    *   **要点：** 强调它是微软开源项目，拥有统一的 API 驱动，支持 Chromium、Firefox 和 WebKit 内核。\n    *   **适用领域：** 测试 (Testing)、脚本编写 (Scripting)、AI 智能体 (AI Agents)。\n    *   **评价：** 稳定、工程化、生态成熟。\n*   **第二列：怎么实现 (Mechanism)**\n    *   **图标：** 齿轮图标。\n    *   **要点：** 它是一个上层自动化框架，封装了点击、输入、等待、上传下载、截图等操作。在 Chromium 上通过对接 CDP（Chrome DevTools Protocol）实现。支持真实浏览器与云端连接。\n    *   **评价：** 高层 API + 底层协议增强。\n*   **第三列：能做到什么 (Capabilities)**\n    *   **图标：** 柱状图/信号图标。\n    *   **要点：** 处理登录、表单、数据抓取、文件上传下载；支持多标签页、iframe、shadow DOM 和网络拦截；支持有头（Headed）、无头（Headless）模式及 CI（持续集成）运行。\n    *   **评价：** 适合固定流程自动化。\n\n### 3. 核心洞察 (CORE INSIGHT)\n位于图片中部的一个深色方框内，左侧配有一个增长曲线图表。\n*   **文字内容：** 强调 Playwright 不是底层协议，而是浏览器自动化框架。它更适合固定业务流程、测试与生产级脚本交付。在 AI 自修复路线上，最适合作为主线执行引擎。\n\n### 4. 底部：关键判断 (Key Judgments)\n分三个小版块总结了实际应用建议：\n*   **适合场景：** （图标：靶心）企业后台、表单填报、数据导出、前端测试。\n*   **登录态支持：** （图标：用户头像）可以使用 persistent context（持久化上下文）、storage state（存储状态），或者连接开启了调试端口的 Chromium。\n*   **推荐定位：** （图标：盾牌）定位为“生产级自动化主线”：即 Playwright 执行 + CDP 增强 + AI 自修复。\n\n### 5. 页脚\n*   **左侧：** PLAYWRIGHT FRAMEWORK NOTE\n*   **右侧：** P. 01 / 01\n\n**总结：** 这张图片旨在为技术决策者或工程师提供关于 Playwright 框架的快速概览，强调了其作为现代自动化工具的成熟度，特别是在生产环境和 AI 结合场景下的优势。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax-portal/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/opt/cclaw-client/UbuntuClaw/cclaw/data/media/inbound/f0c7a93e-63da-47bf-a6cb-89d23db3f465.jpg","attempts":[{"provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-VL-01","error":"The operation was aborted due to timeout | The operation was aborted due to timeout"},{"provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-7","error":"Image model failed (anthropic/claude-opus-4-7): 403 {\"error\":{\"type\":\"forbidden\",\"message\":\"Request not allowed\"}} | Image model failed (anthropic/claude-opus-4-7): 403 {\"error\":{\"type\":\"forbidden\",\"message\":\"Request not allowed\"}}"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778247644023}}
{"type":"message","id":"a875224a","parentId":"07315841","timestamp":"2026-05-08T13:41:00.315Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is another infographic about Playwright - the browser automation framework from Microsoft. Let me summarize it for the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"f09f33650eea9af69a0c852dc014225f9e7e07588a88f2c0873b2d7cf954bba8"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n宝，这张是**Playwright 框架**的介绍图 🧊\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Playwright 是什么\n\n**微软开源**的现代浏览器自动化框架，统一 API 驱动，支持 Chromium、Firefox、WebKit 三大内核\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 核心能力\n\n| 维度 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **是什么** | 浏览器自动化框架，稳定、工程化、生态成熟 |\n| **怎么实现** | 高层 API 封装（点击/输入/等待/上传下载/截图） + CDP 底层增强 |\n| **能做到什么** | 登录、表单、数据抓取、文件上传下载、多标签页、iframe、shadow DOM、网络拦截 |\n\n---\n\n## 💡 关键判断\n\n- **适合场景：** 企业后台、表单填报、数据导出、前端测试\n- **登录态支持：** 持久化上下文（persistent context）、storage state、或连接开启调试端口的 Chromium\n- **推荐定位：** 生产级自动化**主线** = Playwright 执行 + CDP 增强 + AI 自修复\n\n---\n\n## 📊 对比前一张图\n\n第一张说的是 **browser-use × Playwright 混合策略**，这张说的是 **Playwright 作为主线** 的详细说明。两张图是配套的，核心观点一致：\n\n**固定流程用 Playwright，AI 负责出错时的自修复和探索性任务** 🧊"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":848,"output":304,"cacheRead":84352,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85504,"cost":{"input":0.0002544,"output":0.0003648,"cacheRead":0.00506112,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00568032}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778247644026,"responseId":"064d1adca05db3cc01bcf40867ae872b"}}
