{"type":"custom_message","customType":"openclaw.runtime-context","content":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"o9cq802dCUlbYIrFHu3-NkzTM0xk@im.wechat\",\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1778247711363-257d65ba\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-05-08 21:37 GMT+8\"\n}\n```","display":false,"details":{"source":"openclaw-runtime-context"},"id":"1c1c599e","parentId":"5d24122d","timestamp":"2026-05-08T13:41:53.400Z"}
{"type":"message","id":"bf42a389","parentId":"1c1c599e","timestamp":"2026-05-08T13:42:10.768Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants a summary of the three images I just analyzed about browser automation. Let me provide a clear, concise summary.\n","thinkingSignature":"08c21836db7ecefaf55b516dacd5c4578c2febace8f9f121067ae81e0d8425ac"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n宝，这三张图是同一系列的技术报告，讲的是**现代浏览器自动化的技术选型和策略**：\n\n---\n\n## 📊 核心结论\n\n**主线已定：Playwright × browser-use**\n\n固定脚本负责执行，AI 负责诊断、修复与补位\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 三大工具各司其职\n\n| 工具 | 定位 | 角色 | 适用场景 |\n|------|------|------|---------|\n| **Playwright** | 微软开源框架，统一 API | **主线**（主执行引擎） | 企业后台、表单填报、数据导出、前端测试 |\n| **browser-use** | 开源 AI Agent 框架 | **补位**（探索式操作） | 页面变化多、非固定流程、需要动态决策的任务 |\n| **CDP** | Chrome DevTools Protocol | **增强**（底层观测） | 深度状态采集、异常诊断、连接真实/云浏览器 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔄 推荐的协作模式\n\n```\n固定流程 → Playwright（稳定、易维护）\n     ↓ 出错时\n  AI 自修复（browser-use 补位）\n     ↓ 底层支持\n  CDP 增强（状态采集）\n```\n\n---\n\n## 💡 关键洞察\n\n1. **不是全程 AI 接管浏览器**——最优路径是混合方案\n2. **browser-use 不适合替代生产脚本**——它是补位层，不是主线\n3. **生产级框架 = Playwright 主线 + CDP 增强 + AI 自修复**\n\n---\n\n简单说就是：**能固定的用 Playwright 固定，变化的部分交给 AI 处理** 🧊"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1091,"output":359,"cacheRead":85312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86762,"cost":{"input":0.0003273,"output":0.00043079999999999995,"cacheRead":0.005118719999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00587682}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778247713400,"responseId":"064d1b218e48f63f5bc3df527f1d03f8"}}
