{"type":"message","id":"c9b5c6c4","parentId":"6120b007","timestamp":"2026-05-08T13:45:06.652Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"那我们现在已有的功能具不具备上述的这种能力？“Playwright × browser-use**\n\n固定脚本负责执行，AI 负责诊断、修复与补位”"}],"timestamp":1778247906648}}
